Subject: [PATCH] chore: point the license notice at the FSF URL

Use the current GPL URL instead of the postal address so rpmlint no
longer reports an outdated FSF address.

--- a/deepin/gnome-shell/gnome-shell.css
+++ b/deepin/gnome-shell/gnome-shell.css
@@ -13,8 +13,7 @@
  * more details.
  *
  * You should have received a copy of the GNU Lesser General Public License
- * along with this program; if not, write to the Free Software Foundation,
- * Inc., 51 Franklin St - Fifth Floor, Boston, MA 02110-1301 USA.
+ * along with this program; if not, see <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.
  */
 stage {
   font-family: Futura Bk bt, Cantarell, Sans-Serif;
